Rommio's Vulkan-only changes to Azahar, applied after azahar.patch and azahar-mvd.patch by
scripts/cores/build_azahar_vulkan_probe.py:
- Rebuild the Vulkan shader cache after loading a savestate.
- iOS Simulator: stage texel-buffer writes into GPU-private memory.
- Upload the procedural-texture lookup tables when any of them changes, as the OpenGL
  renderer does. Upstream Vulkan uploads only when the colour table changes, so a game that
  rewrites just the noise, colour-map or alpha-map table drew with the old one.
- Point every folder derived from the user folder at the current one each time it's set. The
  core stays loaded between games, and keeping the first game's SD card and NAND folders made a
  later game save where Rommio's save capture didn't look.

Written with AI models (Codex and Claude). Azahar's AI-POLICY.md prohibits AI-written
contributions, so these changes must not be submitted to Azahar.

